  "label": "Social Norms",
  "description": "Social norms are unwritten rules that govern behavior in society. The meme plays on the social norm that romantic relationships are distinct from familial relationships, and that redefining a romantic breakup as a familial bond (cousins) is socially inappropriate and absurd. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the humor and social commentary.",
